---------------------

The MIT Licence below covers the contents of this repository only: the source code, the
documentation. External datasets retain their own licences and attribution requirements.

It does NOT cover the More than a Hack 2027 match data (videos, tracking data, Smart Tagging,
homography). Those assets are separately licensed for the competition only, under the terms
accepted at enrolment, and nothing below grants any right to use or redistribute them.

The official evaluation utilities and adapted tactical-format reader originate from
https://github.com/metrica-sports/more-than-a-hack-2027, which is also MIT licensed, and keep
their original copyright notice.

